( F5 T4 U5a: control_mesh_extrude 6.179 and control_mesh_extrude_n 6.185.
  One quad4 and two tria3 extruded over z 0 1 3 with n 1 2 1: three
  element layers [z 0-1, 1-2, 2-3], the 2D nodes become the plane z 0,
  plane p of node i is node 6p+i, layer l of element e is element 3l+e;
  quad4 a b c d -> hex8 a b a' b' c d c' d', tria3 -> prism6. Mesh =
  Professional 02-08-2026 [build_safe compares the .dbs mesh]. Old GNU:
  the 2D nodes stayed as an extra bottom layer at z 0 and _n was ignored. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1  0.0 0.0 0.0
node 2  1.0 0.0 0.0
node 3  2.0 0.0 0.0
node 4  0.0 1.0 0.0
node 5  1.0 1.0 0.0
node 6  2.0 1.0 0.0
element 1  -quad4  1 2 4 5
element 2  -tria3  2 3 5
element 3  -tria3  3 6 5
element_group 1 0
element_group 2 1
element_group 3 1
group_type -ra 0 1 -ra -materi
group_materi_elasti_young -ra 0 1 -ra 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson -ra 0 1 -ra 0.2
group_materi_density -ra 0 1 -ra 0.
control_mesh_extrude 10 0. 1. 3.
control_mesh_extrude_n 10 1 2 1
end_data
